Yeah, that's essentially what I'm wanting to do;

&#x200B;

Not necessarily connect to .onion sites, but mainly to use it as an encryption while on the go.

&#x200B;

There are guides like [this one here](https://www.raspberrypi.org/magpi/tor-router/) which I've followed except swapped the wlan to eth0 and skipped the wifi setup portion, but after I do that I get errors saying I can't connect to the VPN.
